{"id":"450432a0e779ee1f","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-typed-term-positions.md","title":"顶点位置、边位置与细化前缀序","display":"df-typed-term-positions — 顶点位置、边位置与细化前缀序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-typed-term-positions","aliases":["56-df-typed-term-positions"],"display":"df-typed-term-positions — 顶点位置、边位置与细化前缀序","depends_on":["[[56-df-position]]"],"source_section":"§8.6.1 Definitions 8.6.3; Examples 8.6.4–8.6.5","source_printed_pages":"388","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-pair-coding-local"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-typed-term-positions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-typed-term-positions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-typed-term-positions — 顶点位置、边位置与细化前缀序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6.1 Definitions 8.6.3; Examples 8.6.4–8.6.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"388"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-pair-coding-local"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,W,\\epsilon,\\operatorname{Pos},\\cdot,\\prec\">\\(T,W,\\epsilon,\\operatorname{Pos},\\cdot,\\prec\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in W\">\\(p,q\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。二元组的第二坐标0、1分别编码朝向顶点的边与顶点本身；边根位置也属于位置全集。下列关系限制在当前项的位置全集中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E(p)\\coloneqq(p,0),\\qquad V(p)\\coloneqq(p,1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E(p)\\coloneqq(p,0),\\qquad V(p)\\coloneqq(p,1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\cdot(q,k)\\coloneqq(p\\cdot q,k)\\qquad(p,q\\in W,\\ k\\in\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\cdot(q,k)\\coloneqq(p\\cdot q,k)\\qquad(p,q\\in W,\\ k\\in\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(p,k)\\sqsubseteq_s(q,h)\\iff (p,k),(q,h)\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\land\n\\bigl(p\\prec q\\lor(p=q\\land k\\le h)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(p,k)\\sqsubseteq_s(q,h)\\iff (p,k),(q,h)\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\land\n\\bigl(p\\prec q\\lor(p=q\\land k\\le h)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z\\sqsubset_s w\\iff z\\sqsubseteq_s w\\land z\\ne w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z\\sqsubset_s w\\iff z\\sqsubseteq_s w\\land z\\ne w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\coloneqq\n\\{(E(p),V(p)),(V(p),E(p))\\mid p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\}\n\\cup\\{(V(p),E(p\\cdot(i))),(E(p\\cdot(i)),V(p))\\mid p\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\coloneqq\n\\{(E(p),V(p)),(V(p),E(p))\\mid p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\}\n\\cup\\{(V(p),E(p\\cdot(i))),(E(p\\cdot(i)),V(p))\\mid p\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in P\\mid\\exists w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\setminus P\\;(z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\}\n\\qquad(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in P\\mid\\exists w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\setminus P\\;(z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\}\n\\qquad(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条树边在此是一个独立位置，不与所指向顶点合并；细化顺序满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(p)\\sqsubset_s V(p)\\sqsubset_s E(p\\cdot(i))\">\\(E(p)\\sqsubset_s V(p)\\sqsubset_s E(p\\cdot(i))\\)</span>。边根 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(\\epsilon)\">\\(E(\\epsilon)\\)</span> 记录项与上文的接口，即使根处发生collapsing收缩也不能省略。边界只取集合内部、邻接其补集的位置。所有集合和关系均由有限位置集显式构造，无递归存在义务。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供Terese本地DjVu文字层。印刷第388页的上下标在OCR中部分丢失，本原子以有类型的有序对重建原书明确说明的vertex/edge区分；没有把普通位置后裔当作两类trace。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,W,\\epsilon,\\operatorname{Pos},\\cdot,\\prec$ 见 [[56-df-position]]。$s\\in T$，$p,q\\in W$，$i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$。二元组的第二坐标0、1分别编码朝向顶点的边与顶点本身；边根位置也属于位置全集。下列关系限制在当前项的位置全集中。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,W,\\epsilon,\\operatorname{Pos},\\cdot,\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"E(p)\\coloneqq(p,0),\\qquad V(p)\\coloneqq(p,1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{0,1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"p\\cdot(q,k)\\coloneqq(p\\cdot q,k)\\qquad(p,q\\in W,\\ k\\in\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"(p,k)\\sqsubseteq_s(q,h)\\iff (p,k),(q,h)\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\land\n\\bigl(p\\prec q\\lor(p=q\\land k\\le h)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"z\\sqsubset_s w\\iff z\\sqsubseteq_s w\\land z\\ne w.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\coloneqq\n\\{(E(p),V(p)),(V(p),E(p))\\mid p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\}\n\\cup\\{(V(p),E(p\\cdot(i))),(E(p\\cdot(i)),V(p))\\mid p\\cdot(i)\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bd}_s(P)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in P\\mid\\exists w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\setminus P\\;(z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Adj}_s\\}\n\\qquad(P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)).","display":true},{"tex":"E(p)\\sqsubset_s V(p)\\sqsubset_s E(p\\cdot(i))","display":false},{"tex":"E(\\epsilon)","display":false}],"bytes":2185,"backlinks":[{"id":"16a1ffeeec4f6ecf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,\\operatorname{Adj},\\operatorname{Bd},\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[56-df-typed-term-positions]]。$s\\in T$，$P\\subseteq\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$；有限位置路径允许零条边，$z_0,\\ldots,z_n$ 为位置序列。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-typed-term-positions.md]]"}],"outgoing":["da02033e6d596cae"]}